    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for retrieving real-time and historical ADS-B aircraft state vectors, flight tracks, and airport arrival and departure data from the OpenSky Network crowd-sourced receiver network. Intended for non-commercial research and educational use.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpenSky Network\n Email: contact@opensky-network.org",
